              <para id="para-00046">Graph the linear inequality \(y\;>\;\frac52x\;-\;4\). Use the graphing tool
          or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality using the Desmos tool below.</para>

              <para id="para-00047">When you have finished graphing, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
          button to compare your work.</para>
            </problem>
            <solution id="sol-00010">
              <para id="para-00048">Compare your answer:</para>
              <!--REPLACE
              IMAGE BELOW WITH CORRECT IMAGE-->
              <para id="para-00049">All points in the shaded region represent the solutions
          to \(y\;>\;\frac52x\;-\;4\)</para>
              
                <media alt="">
                  <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_14_08_02.jpg"/>
                </media>
              
            </solution>
          </exercise>
          
